  "body": "## Summary\n- Make `scripts/check-executed-tests.mjs` comment-/literal-aware so `#[cfg(test)]` inside doc comments no longer invents a false-dark lib binary (`console-m68`).\n- Live `#[cfg(test)]` still fail-closed; empty src inventory fails examined-zero.\n- Tip `415be459140c28f36312b4533611797ad691ddbf` (`%G?=G`). Critic dispatch in flight.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `node --test scripts/check-executed-tests.test.mjs` (10 pass)\n- [x] `node scripts/check-executed-tests.mjs` (exit 0)\n- [ ] Native lane-critic receipt APPROVE\n- [ ] Required CI green\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
